---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import photo from '../assets/steve.jpg';
import Draft from './Draft.astro';
interface Props {
  link?: boolean;
}
const { link = true } = Astro.props;
---

<div class="about">
  <div class="reveal">
    <Image class="about-photo" src={photo} alt="Steve Harrison, founder of AI Growth Systems" width={200} height={200} />
  </div>
  <div class="reveal">
    <span class="eyebrow">Who’s behind this</span>
    <h2 class="mt-4">AI that grows the business, not automations for their own sake.</h2>
    <p class="lead mt-5">
      AI Growth Systems was founded by Steve Harrison. He has more than 10 years in marketing: Google Ads, Facebook Ads,
      websites that convert, and email and SMS follow-up. Today he puts AI to work inside businesses.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4">
      That mix matters. Plenty of people can build an automation. Far fewer know which ones help a business grow.
      We start with how you win and keep customers, then set up the AI that supports it.
    </p>
    {link && <p class="mt-6"><a class="text-link" href="/about">More about us</a></p>}
    <Draft>First-draft wording for you to approve. The photo is small (200 pixels), so it’s shown small; a larger one would look sharper.</Draft>
  </div>
</div>
